[{"data":1,"prerenderedAt":80},["ShallowReactive",2],{"header-locale:\u002Farchives\u002Fpage\u002F88\u002F":3,"archive-page:zh-Hant:88":4,"author-stats:zh-Hant:full":78},null,{"posts":5,"total":76,"totalPages":77},[6,15,24,30,36,42,48,56,63,70],{"url":7,"title":8,"date":9,"updated":3,"category":10,"tags":11,"description":13,"readingMinutes":14},"\u002Fgit\u002F20190621\u002F4239571950\u002F","GitHub 發生衝突該如何解決","2019-06-21 16:35:09","Git",[12,10],"GitHub","當參加團隊專案開發的時候，其實很容易發生程式碼衝突問題，那這邊就來講一下該如何解除衝突吧~","2",{"url":16,"title":17,"date":18,"updated":3,"category":19,"tags":20,"description":22,"readingMinutes":23},"\u002Fjavascript\u002F20190621\u002F538821393\u002F","CoffeeScript 三元運算子","2019-06-21 11:49:07","JavaScript",[19,21],"CoffeeScript","這邊紀錄一下 CoffeeScript 的三元運算子該如何撰寫","1",{"url":25,"title":26,"date":27,"updated":3,"category":19,"tags":28,"description":29,"readingMinutes":23},"\u002Fjavascript\u002F20190621\u002F4177225789\u002F","CoffeeScript event 沒有反應","2019-06-21 10:19:54",[19,21],"撰寫 CoffeeScript 的時候發生一件怪事情，event 事件竟然無法使用，所以這邊紀錄一下我曾經做過哪些事情以及解決方式",{"url":31,"title":32,"date":33,"updated":3,"category":19,"tags":34,"description":35,"readingMinutes":14},"\u002Fjavascript\u002F20190620\u002F3794703376\u002F","CoffeeScript 基礎學習","2019-06-20 10:52:16",[19,21],"由於可能專案使用上的需求將會撰寫 CoffeeScript，所以這邊就來稍微摸一下 CoffeeScript 是什麼鬼，又可以用什麼方式來撰寫",{"url":37,"title":38,"date":39,"updated":3,"category":19,"tags":40,"description":41,"readingMinutes":14},"\u002Fjavascript\u002F20190619\u002F3418592009\u002F","JavaScript 扁平化多維陣列","2019-06-19 14:45:37",[19],"今天遇到一個需求需要將多維陣列扁平化，這邊紀錄一下我查到的資料該怎麼做，順便記錄一下今天看到的 ES 2019 的方式",{"url":43,"title":44,"date":45,"updated":3,"category":19,"tags":46,"description":47,"readingMinutes":14},"\u002Fjavascript\u002F20190618\u002F3285272502\u002F","GitHub API contents file date 亂碼解決方法","2019-06-18 11:40:06",[19,12],"這幾天在使用 GitHub API 中的一個 API 方法發現 content 會出現亂碼問題，這邊紀錄一下該如何解決 content 亂碼",{"url":49,"title":50,"date":51,"updated":3,"category":19,"tags":52,"description":55,"readingMinutes":14},"\u002Fjavascript\u002F20190617\u002F3829122039\u002F","使用 Google Apps Script 解決 CORS 問題","2019-06-17 13:24:47",[19,53,54],"Google Apps Script","CORS","前端打 API 遇到 CORS 又沒法改後端怎麼辦？這一篇從同源政策（Same-origin policy）的概念講起，用 Google Apps Script 包一層 Proxy 把第三方 API 變成你自己的同源 API， 繞過 CORS 限制。",{"url":57,"title":58,"date":59,"updated":3,"category":60,"tags":61,"description":62,"readingMinutes":23},"\u002Fhexo\u002F20190616\u002F2530364388\u002F","hexo-generator-search 搜尋套件 & 問題","2019-06-16 15:48:32","Hexo",[60],"基本上我們的 Hexo 主題都會使用到搜尋的套件，大多都會使用 hexo-generator-search 這邊紀錄一下一些優化的設置吧。",{"url":64,"title":65,"date":66,"updated":3,"category":10,"tags":67,"description":68,"readingMinutes":69},"\u002Fgit\u002F20190615\u002F4143994266\u002F","GitHub 該如何發 PR(pull request)","2019-06-15 21:33:52",[12,10],"PR 是一個很特別的 GitHub 機制，當然 Gitlab 也有相同的機制，可是我這邊主要只會介紹使用 GitHub 如何發 PR 唷。","3",{"url":71,"title":72,"date":73,"updated":3,"category":10,"tags":74,"description":75,"readingMinutes":14},"\u002Fgit\u002F20190615\u002F1148594701\u002F","基礎 Git 指令","2019-06-15 13:59:25",[10],"這篇文章其實放在我的 EverNote 很久了，但是因為要整理一下 EverNote 特別拿出來重新寫一下作為一個紀錄，也是方便自己之後查找...",1038,104,{"postCount":76,"tagCount":79},1016,1785746151004]